      en: ["Launched: 2018", "Area: 50 km² (19.3 sq mi)", "Expected jobs: 100,000", "GDP contribution: $30 billion", "Renewable energy: Yes (solar and wind)", "Distance from Dhahran: 120 km (75 mi)"],
